## Velocity template for StringConcatenate block output code (C++)
## Concatenates multiple input strings into one output string
##
## Context variables (auto-populated by TemplateUtils):
##   $outputs - List of output signal variable names
##   $inputs - List of input signal variable names
##   $NumberOfInputs - Number of input strings to concatenate
##   $MaximumLength - Maximum length of output string (0 = unlimited)
##   $OutputDimensionsMode - "Fixed-size" or "Variable-size"
##   $blockId - Block ID
